         <div type="div1">
            <head>Variations Chromatiques de Concert / MP3, MIDI and PDF files</head>
            <p rend="justify">Digitization by Songmuh Jong.</p>
            <p rend="justify">In these files are Biset's Variations Chromatiques de concert. They are available as MP3 (for listening), as PDF (the scores), and as MIDI (for playback using MIDI software).</p>
            <p rend="justify">Thanks to Songmuh Jong for creating these files from printed scores.</p>
